# API Design

- Use nouns for resource paths, not verbs
- Return appropriate HTTP status codes
- Use consistent error response shape: `{ code, message, details }`
{{#if parameters.versioned}}
- Version APIs in URL path: `/api/v1/...`
{{/if}}
{{#if parameters.useOpenApi}}
- Document all endpoints with OpenAPI/Swagger
{{/if}}
- Paginate list endpoints with cursor or offset pagination
- Use ISO 8601 for all date/time fields
